# Ordered queue

This file alone owns order and status. Resume in-progress work first; otherwise
select the first ready task whose prerequisites are satisfied. Status vocabulary:
ready, in progress, blocked, planned, done, deferred, rejected. Only done means
acceptance evidence exists. No task is complete just because code was written.

