If interrupted, record here: current result, changed/uncommitted files, missing
checks, external residue, and exact next action. If blocked, record the owner and
unblock condition. Replace obsolete resume instructions when work continues.

When the task reaches done and learning mode is on, rewrite the "What just changed
and why" section of current-state.md to explain this item to the owner. Nothing is
added here. The queue holds the evidence and the explanation lives in one place that
the next item overwrites.

